@Shuttlez.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5139

### Health
GET {{Shuttlez.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/health

### Send OTP (login)
POST {{Shuttlez.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/send-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "+201012345678",
  "purpose": "login"
}

### Verify OTP (dev code: 1234)
POST {{Shuttlez.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/verify-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "+201012345678",
  "code": "1234",
  "purpose": "login"
}

### Register
POST {{Shuttlez.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "+201098765432",
  "fullName": "أحمد محمد علي",
  "email": "ahmed@example.com",
  "gender": "ذكر",
  "code": "1234"
}

### Get Profile (replace TOKEN)
GET {{Shuttlez.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}
